    "title": "Stock Market News Today, 1/30/26 - U.S. Stock Futures Fall after Microsoft Drags Down Nasdaq and S&P - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sheryl Sheth ,\n5 days ago U.S. stock futures fell early Friday after a 10% share price drop in the tech giant Microsoft (MSFT) dragged down the Nasdaq and S&P 500. Futures on the Nasdaq 100 (NDX), the S&P 500 (SPX), and the Dow Jones Industrial Average (DJIA) were down 1.01%, 0.80%, and 0.76%, respectively, at 3:24 a.m. EST on January 30. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
